MDVisualizer-1.0:
- Initial release

MDVisualizer-1.1:
- Added collaboration module

MDVisualizer-1.2:
- Bumped Vrui version requirement to 8.0-001.
- Adapted to new Vrui build system.
- Bumped Vrui Collaboration Infrastructure version requirement to 5.0.
- Adapted to new Collab namespace.
- Rebased collaboration component on Koinonia protocol instead of custom
  protocol and server.

MDVisualizer-1.3:
- Bumped Vrui version requirement to 10.2-001.
- Bumped Vrui Collaboration Infrastructure version requirement to 6.6.
- Fixed installation bugs in makefile.

MDVisualizer-1.4:
- Bumped Vrui version requirement to 10.2-002.
- Bumped Vrui Collaboration Infrastructure version requirement to 8.0.
- Adapted to API changes in Koinonia sub-protocol.

MDVisualizer-1.5:
- Bumped Vrui version requirement to 14.1-001.
- Bumped Vrui Collaboration Infrastructure version requirement to 10.3.
- Adapted to changes in Vrui and Collaboration Infrastructure.
